  "about": {
    "heading": "Software Engineering Student & AI-Driven Developer",
    "photo": "about-photo.png",
    "paragraphs": [
      "I'm an SE student who likes taking a system apart on paper before touching a keyboard — DFDs, use case diagrams, and SRS documents first, code second. That habit currently powers RecycleHub, a system-analysis project turned into a working AI prototype.",
      "I build software with AI as a development partner — writing, debugging, and shipping faster by learning how to work alongside intelligent tools. Alongside coursework, I spend time in the terminal — Linux fundamentals, WSL2 setups, and the lower layers of how an OS actually schedules and runs things.",
      "With 18+ certificates across Python, TensorFlow, NLP, and Generative AI, I keep learning beyond the classroom — always aiming ahead toward DevOps and deeper AI/ML engineering."
    ],
